# Fixhora build secrets.
#
# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in values. The Secrets Gradle Plugin reads `.env` at build
# time and exposes each entry through BuildConfig; `.env` itself is gitignored.
#
# The app is currently local-only (Room is the single source of truth) and needs no API keys to
# build or run. This file is intentionally empty of secrets — add entries here as integrations
# land, so the expected configuration stays documented.
#
# Example, once Google Maps is integrated:
# MAPS_API_KEY=your_maps_sdk_key_here
